            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LetyPat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This soup was pretty good. We were a little skeptical at first...wine and onions??? We cut it down to two servings, used dried parsley and added half a can of chicken broth. It tasted pretty good without the broth, but we think it tasted a little better with it. I think using fresh parsley would have made this dish taste even better. Hooray for 2 buck Chuck!",
            "datePublished": "2007-12-14T22:11:34.503Z"
          }
